# The note is seeded in an arm, read, and then always written on. The two `write_text` calls are one touch that runs on
# the line of each: where the arm does not run, the read finds the note as it was, and the last line writes on what it
# found. Read, then written: both.

route mergedorder.run
line entry > run call
line File(data/note.txt) > run own
line run > File(data/note.txt) own

side entry left
side File(data/note.txt) both
